                                                "sense_id": "b8dcc9ce-e988-3ad5-b681-5e9f7b6fcd8a",
                                                "text": "Underground boards also carried handy programs for \"scanning\" telephone codes and raiding credit card companies, as well as the usual obnoxious galaxy of pirated software, cracked passwords, blue-box schematics, intrusion manuals, anarchy files, porn files, and so forth."
                                            },
                                            {
